data_FeNiCo_disordered
# Disordered Fe-Ni-Co alloy on an fcc lattice (P1).
# Demonstrates partial occupancy: mixed species share a site,
# and the last site is partially vacant (total occupancy < 1).
_chemical_formula_sum 'Fe1.3 Ni0.5 Co0.2'
_cell_length_a 3.60
_cell_length_b 3.60
_cell_length_c 3.60
_cell_angle_alpha 90
_cell_angle_beta 90
_cell_angle_gamma 90
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
